## 📝 Challenge Description
Files can always be changed in a secret way. Can you find the flag? cat.jpg

Hints:
1. Look at the details of the file

2. Make sure to submit the flag as academy{XXXXX}
### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. wget https://challenge-files.cylabacademy.net/library/c585b4adbdaa06f409db7bf5012c2e58e9aab24669764a5f1cf0f9ce0d60dcfd/cat.jpg
2. exiftool cat.jpg
3. echo "YWNhZGVteXt0aGVfbTN0YWRhdGFfMXNfbW9kaWZpZWR9"| base64 -d

```

